WEBVTT

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:01.215
On the left is Manhattan today:

00:03:01.215 --> 00:03:05.602
blue for housing, red for office buildings, retail.

00:03:05.602 --> 00:03:08.201
On the right, we reconfigured it:

00:03:08.201 --> 00:03:10.518
the office buildings form the base,

00:03:10.518 --> 00:03:13.781
and then rising 75 stories above,

00:03:13.781 --> 00:03:15.160
are apartments.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.136
There's a street in the air on the 25th level,

00:03:18.136 --> 00:03:20.150
a community street.

00:03:20.150 --> 00:03:21.759
It's permeable.

00:03:21.759 --> 00:03:23.712
There are gardens and open spaces

00:03:23.712 --> 00:03:25.156
for the community,

00:03:25.156 --> 00:03:28.365
almost every unit with its own private garden,

00:03:28.365 --> 00:03:31.027
and community space all around.